## Style

```yaml
this:
  border-width: 0
  background: "#00000000"
@code_panel:
  background: "#0f1b2d"
  padding: 0, 1, 0, 1
@heading:
  color: "#ddd6fe"
@code:
  color: "#d1d5db"
  word-wrap: true
  user-select: text
```

